, 'INTERVIEWER', 'Alright, thanks. Could you share a bit more detail', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 26, null), ('cmohi9fff002bn20kydm42v4a', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', '你底下就不要', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 27, null), ('cmohi9fff002cn20kxsmj1nl9', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', 'تجزیہی سمجھنا', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 28, null), ('cmohi9fff002dn20kbxuv747i', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it.', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 29, null), ('cmohi9fff002en20kc7clipmy', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', 'Queste tanabobit.', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 30, null), ('cmohi9fff002fn20k0bj3ay6w', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Now, let’s go back a bit—what was your very first project all about?', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 31, null), ('cmohi9fff002gn20kmso8r7y2', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', 'ساہیہ کو صاف کرو کبھی کبھی بزنس بھی نہیں آتا ہے کبھی ساکھ نہیں آتا ہے بھائی ایک بیک اگر رکھنا پردا نہیں کرنا ہے وہ سائیڈ سے جا کے خالی مارکیٹ میں', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 32, null), ('cmohi9fff002hn20k8z6gsj1s', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Thanks for explaining. Let me move to a specific skill now—tell me about your experience with JavaScript in your projects.', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 33, null), ('cmohi9fff002in20krhy9ki37', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Alright, let''s shift focus. Can you describe how you''ve used AWS in your recent work?', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 34, null), ('cmohi9fff002jn20k8xzo83ag', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', '你', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 35, null), ('cmohi9fff002kn20kgcy0fyj5', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I see. Could you provide a bit more detail about the specific AWS services or tools you''ve worked with?', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 36, null), ('cmohi9fff002ln20kab5gezgb', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', 'I really think that.', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 37, null), ('cmohi9fff002mn20kgdlz2dbn', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let’s move on. How comfortable are you working in a Linux environment, including using Bash?', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 38, null), ('cmohi9fff002nn20knw3f7imc', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'CANDIDATE', 'It''s how you express', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 39, null), ('cmohi9fff002on20kr5anyzzg', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. To wrap up, do you have any questions for me about the role or the team?', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 40, null), ('cmohi9fff002pn20kzmppkwjl', 'cmohhx5p3001cn20k0ydkr9wu', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Vikas. We’ve covered the key points. We’ll be in touch with next steps. Take care.', '2026-04-27 18:03:04.155', 41, null), ('cmon8221p001an20klc6ea73y', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 0, null), ('cmon8221p001bn20kxdyoo5cj', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello, Anand. Thank you for joining today. I’m glad to connect. Let’s get started with a quick overview of your background. Could you give me a brief summary of your current role and responsibilities?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 1, null), ('cmon8221p001cn20kqyjqr9sq', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So currently I am working with TMS LLC as a senior technical recruiter. So I have total three years of experience in the US IT recruitment. So basically in this position, I am responsible for end-to-end recruitment cycle to source the candidates from live job portals like Dice, Monster, then screen those candidates and submit to the client. And yeah, that''s it.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 2, null), ('cmon8221p001dn20k6l2hbsnz', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it, thanks for that overview. Let’s dive a bit deeper. Walk me through your recruiting experience in the last 2-3 years. How much of it has been focused on technical roles—like software engineering, data, DevOps, and so on?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 3, null), ('cmon8221p001en20kmfwmfp3k', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So in my past experience of, you know, two to three years, I worked in different type of IT positions with different clients like Google, Microsoft, Mastercard, yeah, we can say, Amazon as well. So we were getting, you know, positions on different areas like .NET, Java, Python, AI, ML, and nowadays we are getting, you know, more into the that machine learning and artificial intelligence. So, yeah.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 4, null), ('cmon8221p001fn20krlwsj328', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Now, tell me about your favorite sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill tech roles. Which tools or platforms do you use most, and can you give me an example of a tough role you successfully sourced?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 5, null), ('cmon8221p001gn20kr5qi6e99', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'Okay, so I would like to start from the typical, you know, IT rules like Java and .NET. So for these typical rules, I used, at first step, I prefer to, you know, go with the monster or dice job boards. So I create a Boolean search as per the job description given by the client. Then as per that Boolean, you know, we got some results matching candidates. So I called one by one. I also used to, you know, email to those candidates the job description. At second step, you know, I would prefer LinkedIn to connect with the matching candidates. And for some tougher role or we can say niche skill, like if I would like to mention, in the recent past, I worked on the position out systems, Alchips consultant. So for, you know, niche skill, I mostly used LinkedIn to, you know, connect with the people for the successful submission.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 6, null), ('cmon8221p001hn20k3alh9qc0', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. Now, how do you evaluate a software engineer’s technical skills during the initial screening stage? What questions or methods do you typically use?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 7, null), ('cmon8221p001in20kcqvrh6hq', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, you know, after getting the perfect match through live job boards like Dice and Monster, I called the people and then sometimes I also used to take help of, you know, AI chatbot to create some screening questions along with some answers in a boot loop in call summit. Then with the help of AI and using my self-knowledge, which I got over the last three to four years, I used to screen the candidate on different different areas as per the job description and requirement of the client. So I basically divide those screening into two sections. One is technical requirement of the client and one is non-technical. So in technical, I used to check the efficiency of the candidate in that particular programming language, application, what he has used in the past project. And in non-technical requirement, I used to verify his current location, his work authorization, and all other, you know, documents of that candidate.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 8, null), ('cmon8221p001jn20kn8i2fw60', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Now, tell me about a time you had to push back on a hiring manager or influence them on a candidate. What was the situation and outcome?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 9, null), ('cmon8221p001kn20k1ugmzooj', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So can you please repeat the question?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 10, null), ('cmon8221p001ln20kkcf8gaz6', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Sure. Tell me about a time you had to push back on a hiring manager or influence them on a candidate. What was the situation and outcome?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 11, null), ('cmon8221p001mn20ksnwx61tu', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So sometimes, you know, there is the situation where candidate is not responsible in terms of sharing the document, in terms of responding. So maybe that''s the situation where, you know, I faced that situation.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 12, null), ('cmon8221p001nn20kumj3o2z5', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I see. And what did you do in that situation with the hiring manager?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 13, null), ('cmon8221p001on20k187zp2xo', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So I tried to persuade that sometimes it happened might be that he is busy in his current project, in his current, you know, project team with the team lead or, you know, members of that team. So and and in the same time in backend, I''m, you know, I''m trying to connect with this employer to make sure that what''s the reason that he is not available, so that, you know, I can get the right cause of the unavailability of the candidate and then, you know, I can manage accordingly.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 14, null), ('cmon8221p001pn20km4x8taaa', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'All right, thanks. Let’s move ahead. What recruiting metrics do you track personally, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 15, null), ('cmon8221p001qn20kv5194qom', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let me ask the final question. Why do you enjoy technical recruiting, and what are you looking for in your next role?', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 16, null), ('cmon8221p001rn20kyi7h7c25', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So in technical recruiting, my first preference is to create our self database of the genuine candidates because nowadays we are facing that a lot of fake candidates are claiming that they are green card, they are you know, US citizens. So now I have started creating my own database of the genuine candidates whose work authorization are genuine, whose technical skills are genuine. So for that, I used to create the data of those candidates who have cleared our internal screening previously in one of our client''s positions. So those candidates are my first choice. So yeah, and as I earlier mentioned, I also used to work on Monster. Even I like, you know, Monster very much because I, like a lot of time, I got a very genuine candidate from Monster. And obviously for niche skills, for some tougher roles, I used to prefer LinkedIn platform.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 17, null), ('cmon8221p001sn20kgn6fu1fw', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'So basically, I love to help the people in getting right jobs for them. So that''s the basic reason. And of course, you know, because I''m, you know, getting enough amount of payment. So that is also the reason.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 18, null), ('cmon8221p001tn20k12pb3bf6', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for sharing that. We’ll wrap up here. I appreciate your time today, Anand. We’ll be in touch soon. Take care.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 19, null), ('cmon8221p001un20k2r87ee3q', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 20, null), ('cmon8221p001vn20k1kpjvm5j', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Have a great day ahead.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 21, null), ('cmon8221p001wn20kp8g30w9p', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Bye, Anand. Take care.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 22, null), ('cmon8221p001xn20k09kcudx5', 'cmon7q62d000tn20kjncl7b0w', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, thanks. Bye.', '2026-05-01 18:04:01.117', 23, null), ('cmon83wjg0020n20k1hy083ew', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 0, null), ('cmon83wjg0021n20k3fxsguvl', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Jaydeep, thank you for joining today. I’m looking forward to our conversation. Let’s start with a brief introduction. Can you tell me about your current role and your main responsibilities as a technical recruiter?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 1, null), ('cmon83wjg0022n20k4hbv30ij', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Sure, so I''m actually acting as a Senior Technical Recruiter at my current role and I''m responsible of taking the IT requirements, servicing them, and then understanding the technical depth of the requirement as to what is required in that job description and then looking forward to source a right suitable candidate from the market that perfectly aligns with my job description and the expectation of the client.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 2, null), ('cmon83wjg0023n20k8p6k354v', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Thanks for sharing that. Now, walk me through your recruiting experience in the last 2-3 years. How much of it has been focused specifically on technical roles, like software engineering or DevOps?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 3, null), ('cmon83wjg0024n20kut56m0rm', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Sure, so if we move around my two to three years of journey as a senior technical recruiter, so most of the time I have been hiring for IT roles such as you described as software engineer or DevOps. So these were the most occurring roles in my career and I have been in touch with a lot of candidates who have been a software developer from, you know, junior to very senior level, architect level, and same goes with the DevOps where I have recruited a lot of candidates that have been working as a DevOps engineer in Azure and in AWS from junior to very senior and architect and, you know, enterprise architect level.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 4, null), ('cmon83wjg0025n20kt2etb37b', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let’s go a bit deeper—what are your favorite sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill tech roles?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 5, null), ('cmon83wjg0026n20k0evo9koc', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for that. Can you give me an example of a tough role you successfully sourced using that approach?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 6, null), ('cmon83wjg0027n20kmcyqostv', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Okay, so in order to fill a very niche kind of role or a very hard role to fill, we first have to understand that requirement really thoroughly. Unless and until we have an idea about as to what is, what exactly is required in that job description or what exactly is required from the candidate, we cannot fill that position. So for that thing, we have to first understand that role. Once we have understood those roles, then we have to, you know, like, there are certain ways you can either send the requirements to your network and, you know, ask them to help you out for that candidate, or you can just, you know, like be on your own and look at the job boards and search for that, but to search a candidate on a hard position or on a niche role, you have to be very, very, very understanding about that position and you have to have a lot of keywords that can fetch a solid resume from the market to you. That''s how you can do it.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 7, null), ('cmon83wjg0028n20kcd54k5n3', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, sure. So there was an position of sale point developer where the client was actually looking for someone with GRC compliances. So when during the starting of that position sourcing, I was just relying on the vendors, but the kind of resume that I was getting from those vendors that were not matching to my role. And I just made a couple of candidates, like I just thoroughly screened a couple of candidates at my own and then presented it with the client. And when they have been to the interview, they didn''t manage to get hold of that position. And due to those reasons, I, you know, like learned that these positions, that position is not that easy and whatever the feedback I collected, I just evaluated the job description, those feedbacks I have evaluated and then You know, made a conclusion that this is the kind of candidate the client is exactly looking and that''s how I just like got enough knowledge as to what exactly look for a candidate and within two to three days, I found the candidate to my own sourcing strategies and I have successfully placed that candidate with that client and that was a long term role.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 8, null), ('cmon83wjg0029n20kr13eb9y1', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Great example. Now, how do you evaluate a software engineer’s technical skills during the initial screening stage?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 9, null), ('cmon83wjg002an20ki85xengc', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'So to evaluate a software engineer''s technical skills, first of all, we have to understand that a software engineer is coming from which programming language as he''s a Java software engineer or he''s a Python software engineer or any other programming language in the market. So first of all, we have to learn about that thing. So we just screen them out like what is that candidate''s primary programming language. Once he tells us about the same, then based on that, we start asking the questions related to the associated frameworks that are really crucial and currently heavily used in current market situations. So if the candidate is having real-time hands-on experience working with those frameworks and he has a complete knowledge of SDLC process, then he should be a definitely good fit for our position. That''s all from my end.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 10, null), ('cmon83wjg002bn20kwkif5zoz', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Now tell me about a time you had to push back on a hiring manager or influence them on a candidate. What was the situation and the outcome?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 11, null), ('cmon83wjg002cn20k4o355jbs', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, sure. So as I''ve previously given you an example that I had a candidate of, like I have a full-for Salesforce developer, so as I said that I have been recruiting for a long period of time on that position. We had made a couple of candidates interviewed and the clients client got actually mad at us that what kind of candidates you''re like putting in in in in different offers. So like when I got this candidate, who my place, so he gave me such a confidence that I just, you know, like blindly told the client that let''s just get him interviewed. If he gets the position, then like, we don''t have to think about the delivering him or anything like that. So like when we get a cab, when we get a uh conference from the client candidate, then that''s that''s when we can just push the client as to let''s just go and go go ahead with him.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 12, null), ('cmon83wjg002dn20kx3s75bz1', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. What recruiting metrics do you track personally, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 13, null), ('cmon83wjg002en20kt9tju5q1', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Le contenu, ma télé', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 14, null), ('cmon83wjg002fn20kn3i2ax72', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Yes, the key performance indicators you track—like time-to-fill, submittals-to-hire, or interview-to-offer ratio. Which metrics do you personally focus on, and which do you find the most important for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 15, null), ('cmon83wjg002gn20kqj0fcecq', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'CANDIDATE', 'Okay, so in that way, I prefer uh like uh quality submissions within the timely frame because that''s what is the major task. If you have submissions but those are not being represented to the client uh frequently and in a timely manner, there is no point. And if you have a submission within the time frame, but that is not quality, that is just a cooked up candidate, then also it is not uh you know, like a good thing to move ahead. In both the cases, you are going to just waste your time, your candidate''s time, and your client''s time, but if you just take care of these two things, like maintaining the maintaining the quality of the candidate submission and at the same time submitting the candidate and representing it to the end client within a timely frame, then the chances of getting that candidate hired are very, very, very high. So that''s what I follow as a first principle.', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 16, null), ('cmon83wjg002hn20ku5saub9b', 'cmon52by5000jn20kjondy4ar', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. One last question—why do you enjoy technical recruiting, and what are you looking for in your next role?', '2026-05-01 18:05:27.292', 17, null), ('cmonflb180034n20kex6rt514', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'morninga, morninga.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 0, null), ('cmonflb180035n20km4wlq4fk', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Good morning, Om. This is a hiring interview for the US Technical Recruiter role. Let’s get started. Could you briefly introduce your current role and your main responsibilities?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 1, null), ('cmonflb180036n20kjigisvte', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hi, good morning.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 2, null), ('cmonflb180037n20k60gy2qji', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Good morning, Om. Let''s begin. To start us off, could you give me a brief introduction to your current or most recent role and your main responsibilities there?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 3, null), ('cmonflb180038n20kcy0frlz3', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hey, hi, like I''m working from last four years as a technical recruiter. Like I have like my bachelor''s from a global university and like BCom, BCA, and like I''m working from last four years as a technical recruiter.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 4, null), ('cmonflb180039n20k5p0xtxnc', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Thanks for sharing that. Let’s dive into your recent recruiting experience. Walk me through your recruiting experience in the last', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 5, null), ('cmonflb18003an20k09ncig77', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Sure. Walk me through your recruiting experience in the last 2 to 3 years. How much of it has been focused on technical roles like software engineering, data, or DevOps?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 6, null), ('cmonflb18003bn20k0afkp36m', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Almost like hundred percent, like I was like working on the technical rules only, and it''s almost hundred percent.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 7, null), ('cmonflb18003cn20k2uzcuew0', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. That’s good to know. Tell me about your favorite sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill tech roles. Which tools or platforms do you use most, and can you give me an example of a tough role you successfully sourced?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 8, null), ('cmonflb18003dn20ka1mcl56t', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Basically, the tools I was using and I''m currently using is like LinkedIn and Monster Dice and basically I didn''t use Dice that much, but like I was using CPAL. In CPAL, I was using Monster LinkedIn and I was, I already, I also used the Indeed and the like this one Smart Recruiter as well. And about the role, the difficult role, I searched like it was a role like for a Genesis, like recently I was working on that. So it was very difficult to get the candidate on a Genesis site because like Genesis is a client and that is uh not that much familiar to the candidates. So I sourced the candidates through the LinkedIn, through the uh smart recruiters and all like I screened them very well, like I I got get some questions. I I I get some questions from the client side and I screened them and I have already a experience of screening a technical screening to a technical screening for the candidate. So I did and like I closed the candidate and submitted.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 9, null), ('cmonflb18003en20k43cs6hnb', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Thanks for that. Now, how do you evaluate a software engineer’s technical skills during the initial screening stage?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 10, null), ('cmonflb18003fn20kaxnql9v8', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'That''s all.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 11, null), ('cmonflb18003gn20kvv7s1b8z', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 12, null), ('cmonflb18003hn20k9h6pbl7n', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'For example, do you ask them specific technical questions, or use coding assessments, or rely on something else?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 13, null), ('cmonflb18003in20ku0fvn4b2', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'See, if the role would be on a like for the coding side, so I have some of the like questions and like I have some of the coding questions, so I will ask them to do the coding in front of me in a screening video screening. And if the role is technical one, so I have some I will get some questions from the internet or ChatGPT and I will screen them from the ChatGPT something. And I will screen the candidates from those technical questions and I will evaluate, first the things I have to do is I will evaluate the JD, okay. I will see like what the basically the client is looking for first like once it would be done. So I will see the JD, I will understand the JD, what the client is looking for, specifically if they are looking for any of the technologies. So I will go through with the technologies and after that like I will screen the candidate based on the technologies, what the client is looking for, what the skills client is looking for. I will ask them technical questions if the role is based on the coding side. If like example, like the client is asking the candidate who have a very good at the coding side, so I will ask them to do a coding in front of me. So I will get into them in a video screening and ask them to do a coding in front of me. That''s it.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 14, null), ('cmonflb18003jn20kwebf56fi', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let’s move on. Tell me about a time you had to push back on a hiring', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 15, null), ('cmonflb18003kn20kdnbcq63w', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 16, null), ('cmonflb18003ln20kkqfje2g5', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'What was the situation and outcome when you had to influence a hiring manager on a candidate?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 17, null), ('cmonflb18003mn20kqboaz0y7', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'The situation would come like I will always try to connect the candidate with the hiring managers and it would be upon the hiring manager what the hiring manager is asking and all. That''s it.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 18, null), ('cmonflb18003nn20k0nykv931', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let me clarify a bit. Can you share an example where you had a differing opinion from the hiring manager about', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 19, null), ('cmonflb18003on20kw1f7npx6', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'disco.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 20, null), ('cmonflb18003pn20kx1l2x6yr', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Because based on the my side, like I will screen the candidate, and I will give my best to screen the candidate. I will first I will understand how the candidate is. If it is very good and like he have a fluent communication, he have a very good experience on the skills, then only I will influence the candidate with the hiring manager.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 21, null), ('cmonflb18003qn20k4xblq5bu', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I see what you mean. Let’s shift gears. What recruiting metrics do you track personally, and which ones matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 22, null), ('cmonflb18003rn20kksa5tx3c', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Let me ask a bit differently: can you give an example of a specific situation where you recommended a candidate, but the hiring manager had concerns, and you had to address that?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 23, null), ('cmonflb18003sn20kfrq9eka8', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mm-hmm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 24, null), ('cmonflb18003tn20klb0v1zyp', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'For example, can you tell me about a time when you believed in a candidate, but the hiring manager was unsure, and how you handled that?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 25, null), ('cmonflb18003un20k0vxylkkd', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'See, it all depends on the hiring manager because like from my side, whatever the experience I have, I will give my best and I will screen the candidate. It''s okay. And after that, like it all depends on the hiring manager how he is asking, how she is asking. Sometimes it also went like some type of hiring managers are looking for some other type of candidates, basically like for the regions, like if they are asking for the MSD candidate and I submitted for the CSU, so they will reject the candidate. And if he will ask the candidate to come onshore like for the on-site, so then I have to communicate the client with the client and then I will understand the reason of the hiring manager''s hesitation and address it by sharing more details, clarify with the candidate or arranging another round if the hiring manager is comfortable for that. And my focus will be to remove in removing the doubts of the candidate and help the manager to make a confident decision about the candidate.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 26, null), ('cmonflb18003vn20kwtppdpcl', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for explaining that. Let’s shift to metrics. What recruiting metrics do you track personally, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 27, null), ('cmonflb18003wn20ktercj21a', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 28, null), ('cmonflb18003xn20kxw5t6763', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Now, let’s talk about recruiting metrics. What metrics do you track personally, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 29, null), ('cmonflb18003yn20km5ptoz88', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Matrices I didn''t get you like can you give me an example like this type of matrix are you looking for?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 30, null), ('cmonflb18003zn20kn5e348sy', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Sure. For example, metrics like time-to-fill, submittal-to-interview ratio, or offer acceptance rate.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 31, null), ('cmonflb180040n20kpi5effl3', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', '座', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 32, null), ('cmonflb180041n20khifts3gy', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Great. Can you share which of those or other metrics you focus on in your recruiting', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 33, null), ('cmonflb180042n20kleghgo71', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Great.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 34, null), ('cmonflb180043n20kjrwg8dy5', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 35, null), ('cmonflb180044n20km6ukx4a8', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'For example, do you track how long it takes to fill roles, or how many candidates move from submittal to interview?', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 36, null), ('cmonflb180045n20kzx5m327w', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 37, null), ('cmonflb180046n20kfbcdvbrp', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let’s move to the last question. Why do you enjoy technical recruiting, and what are you looking for in your next', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 38, null), ('cmonflb180047n20kuggq368n', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Рашен.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 39, null), ('cmonflb180048n20km53iiikw', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Go ahead, share why you enjoy technical recruiting, and what you''re looking for in your next role.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 40, null), ('cmonflb180049n20kuxqe9ecm', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'I enjoy the recruiting because, like, I am happy to help the people, okay? I will help the people, I will help the candidates to get the best, like, the best salary in the market, okay? I am very happy to help the people to get the good role as per their like profile. And I''m interested in IT recruiting because it allows me to work work at the, like, interaction of the technologies and like with the people. And I already, I always like enjoyed, like, the sourcing the candidates and like connecting with the new peoples, like talking with them, and like, I always try to get them into a best roles with the best salary, so they will be also happy for me as well as I will be happy for them. And like I''ve always helped them to grow in their fields.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 41, null), ('cmonflb18004an20k4akhm3ux', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Om. I appreciate your insights. That wraps up our interview. We’ll be in touch soon. Take care and', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 42, null), ('cmonflb18004bn20k1v4vqa8r', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Mhm, thank you.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 43, null), ('cmonflb18004cn20kg9vqzdng', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Best of luck, Om. Take care.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 44, null), ('cmonflb18004dn20kvt7wrvej', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yep, have a good one.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 45, null), ('cmonflb18004en20kr7g6sl5l', 'cmonf7ke7002nn20klh3mh943', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You too. Have a great day ahead. Goodbye.', '2026-05-01 21:34:56.54', 46, null), ('cmong2tgu004hn20kaujrj3fo', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2',