, '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 7, null), ('cmong2tgu004pn20k8sjc3ayn', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Thanks for that. Now, tell', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 8, null), ('cmong2tgu004qn20k1udsm4j2', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello, yeah.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 9, null), ('cmong2tgu004rn20kwdjfyjz9', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'What are your favorite sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill tech roles? Which tools or platforms do you use most, and can you give me an example of a tough role you successfully sourced?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 10, null), ('cmong2tgu004sn20kiiiwvx3q', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, please.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 11, null), ('cmong2tgu004tn20kxox3y9fw', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'No problem—take your time. Could you share some of your favorite sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill tech roles, and maybe give an example of a tough role you successfully sourced?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 12, null), ('cmong2tgu004un20ktwngae94', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, sure. Actually, we are sourcing from the dies, moisturizer, and also we are taking help of LinkedIn. Okay, and also we are searching or screening candidates from our internal database. Okay, so for the top roles, firstly, I am screening and the JD. Okay, firstly, I am screening the JD very carefully. So if I cannot understand the JD, what exactly they are asking, so I will take help from the AI tools like ChatGPTs, and also I will contact my hiring manager to understand the role exactly what clients needed, which type of candidate they need.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 13, null), ('cmong2tgu004vn20ktztw70yy', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'So after discussing with my manager and after taking the help of AI tools, I will source in the candidates.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 14, null), ('cmong2tgu004wn20kdf1s2nqw', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Let’s dive a bit deeper: how do you evaluate a software engineer’s technical skills during the initial screening stage? What questions or methods do you use?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 15, null), ('cmong2tgu004xn20k0e0twitw', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'For software engineering, I will ask questions. I will take help from the ChatGPTs to understand the technical questions, how we can judge the candidate and explain them what''s the questions. And also, I will ask some questions from the ChatGPTs. I will take the help from that one.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 16, null), ('cmong2tgu004yn20k36fdf3m1', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let me ask:', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 17, null), ('cmong2tgu004zn20k28qsfbk1', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'And also I will go Google it some questions and ask you depending.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 18, null), ('cmong2tgu0050n20k5hv2g2u7', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'to understand that they are a good fit for this role or not.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 19, null), ('cmong2tgu0051n20keb877tcx', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing. Now, tell me about a time you had to push back on a hiring manager or influence them on a candidate—what happened and what was the outcome?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 20, null), ('cmong2tgu0052n20kc1ud3v49', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Ah, sorry.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 21, null), ('cmong2tgu0053n20kz19a2wp6', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'No problem. Let me rephrase. Can you recall a situation where you had to convince a hiring manager to reconsider a candidate? What was the situation and the outcome?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 22, null), ('cmong2tgu0054n20ki020tsk7', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so firstly, if I got any role, a particular any role, and I got a suitable candidate for that role, so if the rate is candidates asking for more rates, and so I will contact with my manager to convince that the candidate is good for this role. He has all the skills which clients need for this role. So I will try to convince my manager to consider the profile. And if the rate recites, so I will', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 23, null), ('cmong2tgu0055n20kjzhlpi2q', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Discuss with my manager if we can increase the rate and close the candidate on that rate.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 24, null), ('cmong2tgu0056n20kale3n9dd', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for that example. What recruiting metrics do you personally track, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 25, null), ('cmong2tgu0057n20k2ljtzr71', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Ja.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 26, null), ('cmong2tgu0058n20kqqsx00gv', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Now, what recruiting metrics do you track personally, and which ones do you think matter most for technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 27, null), ('cmong2tgu0059n20kdabnok40', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'recruiting metrics, sorry.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 28, null), ('cmong2tgu005an20kf5ppu5no', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I’m asking about metrics—like time-to-fill, submission-to-hire ratio, or offer acceptance rate. Which ones do you track, and which are most important in technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 29, null), ('cmong2tgu005bn20k11i43qcf', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so for the technical recruiting, the most important thing is to close the candidates in a given time. Okay, so we are hiring the candidates with the given time which we have to fill the position as soon as possible.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 30, null), ('cmong2tgu005cn20k1z89gkjd', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. And lastly, why do you enjoy technical recruiting, and what are you looking for in your next role?', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 31, null), ('cmong2tgu005dn20k3k6htl5u', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so in technical recruitment, I choose because it allows me to combine my interest in technologies with my strength in connecting with people.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 32, null), ('cmong2tgu005en20ka4k9meri', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for sharing that, Divyanshu. I appreciate your time today. We''ll be in touch soon with the next steps. Take care.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 33, null), ('cmong2tgu005fn20km2pimnhm', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, thank you so much.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 34, null), ('cmong2tgu005gn20k43bfxuyl', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Good luck, and have a great day ahead.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 35, null), ('cmong2tgu005hn20kedbjc2rm', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 36, null), ('cmong2tgu005in20k7t423jxx', 'cmonfinb7002xn20k1xvepnz2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Goodbye.', '2026-05-01 21:48:33.582', 37, null), ('cmonh01wn005vn20kppfrw5mg', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hi Adarsh, thank you for joining today. Let’s get started. First, can you briefly introduce yourself and tell me about your current role as a technical recruiter?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 0, null), ('cmonh01wn005wn20kqzmj9vou', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'はい。', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 1, null), ('cmonh01wn005xn20km74yjh8a', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hi Adarsh, good to meet you. Let’s start with a quick introduction. I’m here to conduct your interview for the US Technical Recruiter role. Could you tell me briefly about your current role and experience in technical recruiting?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 2, null), ('cmonh01wn005yn20k0nxfuhw7', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello, my voice is clear?', '2026-05-01 22