 and share the example when you''re ready.', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 46, null), ('cmonh01wo0076n20kya8ost3c', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, please ask me the question. I am waiting.', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 47, null), ('cmonh01wo0077n20kmfij3wa9', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Sure, Adarsh. Let me repeat. Can you share an example of a difficult tech role that you successfully sourced, and walk me', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 48, null), ('cmonh01wo0078n20kpzlu0s2h', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'Es prasās.', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 49, null), ('cmonh01wo0079n20kg6v316a8', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Of course, Adarsh. Let me ask it again clearly. Can you give me an example of a tough technical role that you successfully sourced, and how you approached it?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 50, null), ('cmonh01wo007an20k2nreubjo', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'I''ll try to close some better profiles and try to submit some better profiles.', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 51, null), ('cmonh01wo007bn20kbdpvau8w', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let me repeat the question clearly. Can you give me an example of a tough technical role that you successfully sourced, and how you approached it?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 52, null), ('cmonh01wo007cn20kofn7b7o5', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 53, null), ('cmonh01wo007dn20k0lmpbq9e', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Adarsh, let me repeat the question clearly. Can you give me an example of a tough technical role that you successfully sourced, and how you approached it?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.167', 54, null), ('cmonh01wo007en20k8y3uvlwe', 'cmongiroa005on20kjwgnvwyv', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Adarsh, let me repeat the question clearly. Can you give me an example of a tough technical role that you successfully sourced, and how you approached it?', '2026-05-01 22:14:24.