42:37.82', 0, null), ('cmpzjovek003alk0khrvtddcq', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Niv, it''s great to meet you. Let''s dive right in. Can you tell me about your background and how it maps to this HR role?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 1, null), ('cmpzjovek003blk0k4u850bdc', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Could you share more about your studies and any experience you''ve gained so far related to HR?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 2, null), ('cmpzjovek003clk0k35fxsgvw', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'I recently completed my degree.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 3, null), ('cmpzjovek003dlk0kwvhh0olk', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. What specific projects', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 4, null), ('cmpzjovek003elk0kb54xdz0w', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'from looking at it.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 5, null), ('cmpzjovek003flk0kg626fozb', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. How would you handle a challenging employee relations issue?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 6, null), ('cmpzjovek003glk0k5udl05l4', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'I recently completed my degree in MCA and from during studies I have developed a strong knowledge in, I also work on projects in such a name of which have my improved problem solving and teamwork skills and eager to start my professional career, apply to my college practical environment and continue learning improving with organization. I have experience in two years I started my career as a first role and as I gradually took more responsibility and eager such as in my most recent role, I work on major where I contribute to, throughout my career I have developed strong skills, I am now looking for opportunity where I further contribute and grow processing.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 7, null), ('cmpzjovek003hlk0kshlwbz1n', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'I stay organised in priority tasks and focus on solutions rather than problems. This helps me stay client productive under pressure.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 8, null), ('cmpzjovek003ilk0k2r4oq3f6', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Can you walk me through a specific example of a tough decision you had to make related to HR?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 9, null), ('cmpzjovek003jlk0kb6ivg2qm', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Und doch ist es schon auch Neugier.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 10, null), ('cmpzjovek003klk0kkr47ij7i', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Think of any situation where you had to resolve a conflict or make a judgment call. Can you recall one?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 11, null), ('cmpzjovek003llk0klt8bedj9', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes, I enjoy working with teams. I believe our collaboration leads to better ideas for the end result. I will be a successfully popped-up team.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 12, null), ('cmpzjovek003mlk0k8vej953r', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Let''s shift to this: how do you approach building an effective recruitment strategy?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 13, null), ('cmpzjovek003nlk0kn99udxjb', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'My strengths include strong communication skills, problem-solving ability, and adaptability. For example, in the previous work, I handled the beach and proved my result.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 14, null), ('cmpzjovek003olk0khyiil050', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How do you measure the success of your HR initiatives?', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 15, null), ('cmpzjovek003plk0k6pjwzwky', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'I bring the right combination of skills, dedication and willingness to learn. I can contribute to your team by and I am committed to delivering high quality work.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 16, null), ('cmpzjovek003qlk0kh4geztbg', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Niv. That concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 17, null), ('cmpzjovek003rlk0kqnpboqia', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 18, null), ('cmpzjovek003slk0k2u9kwfjy', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Take care, and all the best ahead.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 19, null), ('cmpzjovek003tlk0kwbjfbxwg', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Valeu!', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 20, null), ('cmpzjovek003ulk0k6znks8lp', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Goodbye, and have a great day, Niv.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 21, null), ('cmpzjovek003vlk0k9fmimlj0', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Same to you.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 22, null), ('cmpzjovek003wlk0ktr8omgrb', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Take care. This concludes our session. Best of luck.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 23, null), ('cmpzjovek003xlk0ks0g0b2zg', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 24, null), ('cmpzjovek003ylk0k5ib8u9ji', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re very welcome. Goodbye.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 25, null), ('cmpzjovek003zlk0kbi9caazc', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Good night', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 26, null), ('cmpzjovek0040lk0k34kb5c3r', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Goodbye, Niv. Take care.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 27, null), ('cmpzjovek0041lk0k5fd48mym', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Goodbye.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 28, null), ('cmpzjovek0042lk0koo6f22pb', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Goodbye. All the best.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 29, null), ('cmpzjovek0043lk0kjqyetlrm', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 30, null), ('cmpzjovek0044lk0k822ox5jl', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Take care.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 31, null), ('cmpzjovek0045lk0k62iryx51', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'CANDIDATE', 'Take care.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 32, null), ('cmpzjovek0046lk0kpd5m2oxz', 'cmpzjg3rx0037lk0kqk3eqtw9', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Goodbye.', '2026-06-04 13:42:37.82', 33, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004olk0kch6oha3n', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hej då!', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 0, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004plk0kh4w36l85', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello AbD, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s get started. Could you tell me a bit about yourself and your current role?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 1, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004qlk0katfjdrvg', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Go ahead, I''m listening.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 2, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004rlk0kdruylxt7', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 3, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004slk0kvqvmbc5b', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. What’s your current focus in product design right now?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 4, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004tlk0kgo9qtlv8', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'I am a product designer. I have five years of experience in product design and 3D designing. I have worked with softwares like AutoCAD and also in software design and application development. I have around three years of experience. My clients have been companies like Google, Apple, and Microsoft.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 5, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004ulk0ketsqkqh7', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Currently, my focus is on bioframing and MVP preparation. So basically, when the client comes up with an idea, I am getting to the role of converting the idea into prototype, basically starting from idea design and then bioframing and then going for an MVP design and then handing over the MVP to my team for development of a prototype and further.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 6, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004vlk0kesu3hvvm', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Now let’s dig into your experience with UI design. How do you typically approach creating a user interface from scratch?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 7, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004wlk0km9hjjgzj', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, first of all, I gather requirements from the users, based on which I prepare user reports, user stories, sorry, and then with the user stories, we map the entire flow of the UI based on that. I do wireframing on Figma, and then we go for the MVP or prototyping.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 8, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004xlk0kfashbofb', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. And how do you ensure consistency in your UI design when working with a team?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 9, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004ylk0k6n2ck1t4', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'To ensure consistency, basically what I prefer is to gather the entire team together and discuss the problems that we are solving and taking inputs from each and every team member so that each and every feature is taken care of and is linked with the other feature which is developed by some other person in a similar way to ensure consistency. I also make sure that the design is tested in different situation scenarios and gives results the same way as desired.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 10, null), ('cmpzk4vx9004zlk0knzcqu58j', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Let’s move on to your experience with React. How have you used React in your projects?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 11, null), ('cmpzk4vx90050lk0ks51p0i72', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'I have basically used React for reusing elements and using the already available toolkits that are in the React library in my websites that was in the e-commerce and edtech domain.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 12, null), ('cmpzk4vx90051lk0k7g1tgk16', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Can you give me an example of a specific React component you designed and how it improved the product?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 13, null), ('cmpzk4vx90052lk0k3pbbjg9x', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so I used a slideshow feature for showcasing of multiple products and new product launches on our website. And for that, we used browser from the react library, which helped us to show multiple products on the same screen for the user so that they are updated of new designs and then they can make their choices.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 14, null), ('cmpzk4vx90053lk0kruf1ii28', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for that example. One last question: how do you handle feedback on your design work from developers or stakeholders?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 15, null), ('cmpzk4vx90054lk0kjdyuevk0', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Can you repeat the question?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 16, null), ('cmpzk4vx90055lk0k6hxh3hiv', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Sure. How do you handle feedback on your design work from developers or stakeholders?', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 17, null), ('cmpzk4vx90056lk0kt11dn4g9', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so for all the products and the designs, we take due consideration of the inputs of the feedback that we get from the developers, as well as the other stakeholders, especially the users, we collect the smallest of the inputs that we get smallest of the observations or minute observations on any of the features and we treat that with the utmost importance. At the same time, all the inputs are taken, collected and then evaluated based on its priority and complexity, then we after categorizing it into multiple buckets, we solve start solving the problems one at a time starting from the lowest hanging fruits.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 18, null), ('cmpzk4vx90057lk0k52ssbufk', 'cmpzjuoao004mlk0krk2vdvc1', 'INTERVIEWER', 'That makes sense. Thank you for sharing that. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-04 13:55:04.99', 19, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005elk0kfuw8f3nn', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 0, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005flk0ksaq2ta74', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Drashti, my name is Sana, and I''ll be conducting your interview today. Let''s dive in. Can you start by telling us about your background and how it maps to this software developer role?', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 1, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005glk0kq8eyhmcm', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'CANDIDATE', 'But', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 2, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005hlk0kdts0pkju', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'All right, no problem. Let''s go step by step. Tell me a bit about your education and any relevant work experience you have in software development.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 3, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005ilk0ko7p1qqun', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'That''s fine, take a moment if you need. Let''s try this: what got you interested in software development in the first place?', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 4, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005jlk0kf1sadcic', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Drashti, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the software developer role. Let’s get started. Tell me about your background and how it maps to this role.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 5, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005klk0kvopsir2h', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'CANDIDATE', 'or a few miles away.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 6, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005llk0kit5d8pbm', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'That''s fine. Take your time. Go ahead whenever you''re ready.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 7, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005mlk0kflxk4p37', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'No problem, Drashti. Just take a deep breath and share a bit about your background and experience that align with this software developer role.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 8, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005nlk0kilpfiw3x', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'CANDIDATE', 'Oh', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 9, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005olk0krvkcgyiw', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'It''s all right. Let''s start simple. Tell me a little about your education or any projects you''ve worked on recently.', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 10, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005plk0kz5gta1oy', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'CANDIDATE', 'तो तो लिए प्लोग से पेख कर देगा भाईया देट के लिए प्लोग लोगे', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 11, null), ('cmpzk6i8c005qlk0kyvx8ucf3', 'cmpzjs6r4004hlk0ksoy7jmjh', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Drashti, this is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s dive right in. 

Could you start by telling me about your background and how it maps to the software developer role?', '2026-06-04 13:56:20.557', 12, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006alk0kl0oemclg', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 0, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006blk0k59257osj', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Shubham, this is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s start off—tell me about yourself.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 1, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006clk0kcvejqne0', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'I am a product designer. I have five years of experience in 3D design and 2D UI design. I have worked for web development companies and also for additive manufacturing. So I have used a lot of 3D software and 2D software as well as creative designing software. And prototyping and application development platforms.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 2, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006dlk0kecel9oql', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Now, can you tell me about your most recent role and what your primary responsibilities were?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 3, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006elk0k81196wzh', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 4, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006flk0kfkl4h6ux', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'What kind of projects have you worked on recently, and what was your specific role?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 5, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006glk0k5w509wwc', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'Recently, I worked on a product in the edtech domain where we were working on making a website which was a platform for hobby art and craft enthusiasts to come together, show their skills, show what they have made, as well as we incorporated a marketplace for people to make purchases of kits and art supplies to make new art and hobby objects.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 6, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006hlk0kq8rmlsr5', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. And what was your primary contribution to that project''s design and development?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 7, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006ilk0k1frkvh3r', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'In that development, I was looking after the user experience and the user flow. I used to define the user stories and how the components on the platform should look like for attracting users.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 8, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006jlk0kpr3wus5f', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How did you approach the UI design for that platform, and what tools did you use?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 9, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006klk0kah2xtiwk', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'For the UI design, wireframing was primarily done on Figma, and we had the stack of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. We also used a bit of React for specific components, and then there were APIs to call external services for payment, for example.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 10, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006llk0kd5uee7r1', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks. Can you tell me more about your experience with React components in that project?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 11, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006mlk0k92d03wci', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes, so we used libraries of the React to use and reuse components that are already available like Rousel, then Minubar and the features that they have for styling so that our job becomes easier.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 12, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006nlk0kz5tslv6m', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How did you handle any custom UI requirements that weren''t covered by those libraries?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 13, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006olk0kgos13vw4', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'For the custom requirements, we basically hard-coded all the data and then we worked our way through it.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 14, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006plk0kpeu0xr6p', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I see. And how did you ensure that the overall user experience remained consistent across standard and custom components?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 15, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006qlk0kg2nns7nn', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'So we had multiple use cases to test for and we took a huge sample, a very large sample space of around 100 to 150 users and the test conditions were also more than 20-25 test cases to test them in different scenarios and then only if the results were consistent and falling within the limits, we used to go ahead.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 16, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006rlk0kfps8qnv2', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for sharing that. One final question—what’s the most challenging UI problem you’ve solved, and how did you solve it?', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 17, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006slk0k4bbnys7o', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'The most challenging UI problem was about the payment gateway. So the gateway was not intuitive for clients to make purchases, and we used to get a lot of dropouts in the last stages. Also, the conversion of users from browsing to actually making a purchase was very less. So what we did is we reused and redesigned the entire portal, especially the view to buy flow, and then made it so intuitive that the user is drawn to the portal''s experience. And the platform itself drives the user to make a buying option. And then when it lands on the payments gateway, it is so well designed that there are no second thoughts of making the purchase.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 18, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006tlk0koapvfaa0', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Shubham. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 19, null), ('cmpzkn3p4006ulk0k6w7mxev6', 'cmpzkc0ae0068lk0kakupqi63', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you.', '2026-06-04 14:09:14.872', 20, null), ('cmpzljwsl0077lk0kmrk6angl', 'cmpzl6l7g0075lk0kxmyt7aun', 'CANDIDATE', 'एक लाइक्वेट जेल मॉंस्टराइजर यूज़ कर रही हूँ जैसे ये आज मुझे भी जननी का सब से स्वारा दूद पीआ नमस्दे मेरा बाप चलो आज मुंस्टराइजर हेलो', '2026-06-04 14:34:45.574', 0, null), ('cmpzljwsl0078lk0ka3613zt6', 'cmpzl6l7g0075lk0kxmyt7aun', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hi Ankit, this is Sana. I''ll be conducting your interview today for the Business Analytics role. Let''s get started. Tell me about your background and how it maps to this role.', '2026-06-04 14:34:45.574', 1, null), ('cmq6i87ei0005oz01uvvnu8h7', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Sav, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s jump right in. Could you start by telling me a bit about yourself?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 0, null), ('cmq6i87ei0006oz01f0167iog', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 1, null), ('cmq6i87ei0007oz01uh418pt9', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for sharing that. Let’s dive a bit deeper. Could you walk me through some of your experience with UI design?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 2, null), ('cmq6i87ei0008oz01unfq2j60', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello. Yes. I''m my last job as a product design lead. So basically, I have worked for a few companies in the education and tech sector and in the software development sector, primarily working on user experience and UI development. I am aware of UI tools as well as some exposure to backend development. Then I have a total of five years of experience in product design and software development. Yes.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 3, null), ('cmq6i87ei0009oz01fq5bzttz', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes, so I have designed web platforms for e-commerce companies where I used to develop the mock-ups and compiler frames for different web pages and then taking it forward for actual coding on HTML, CSS and JavaScript. So that is what my experience is about it.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 4, null), ('cmq6i87ei000aoz01wd6ct31b', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Now, can you tell me about your experience using React in your projects?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 5, null), ('cmq6i87ei000boz01zf865ly0', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so I have used React for reusability and the ready-made components that are available, libraries that are there in the React toolkit. So I used to use the multiple variants of, you know, Minibar or the carousels and templates that can be reused for different web pages.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 6, null), ('cmq6i87ei000coz01yd9x8akk', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How do you typically approach integrating those React components with your UI designs?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 7, null), ('cmq6i87ei000doz01wb2pd4aw', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'So first I find the best compatibility with my source code and all the dependencies that are required to integrate the React components. So with those things in place, I then do a test run with the implementation and if it works well I move in the line.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 8, null), ('cmq6i87ei000eoz01jy6wf9ll', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thanks for that. What’s one challenge you''ve faced when integrating React with your designs, and how did you solve it?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 9, null), ('cmq6i87ei000foz019ysaf2xv', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'usually it used to have with the compatibility issues like certain React components are not suitable with certain UI requirements and the other programming that I''m doing so I made an entire standardized chart for that with all the references of which components will work well with what settings or what environments and that helped me remove a lot of difficulties from development.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 10, null), ('cmq6i87ei000goz01fmyhs8v4', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'That’s a solid approach. Now, how do you ensure that your designs stay consistent across different devices and screen sizes?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 11, null), ('cmq6i87ei000hoz0123ozubgz', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Sav. One final question: what excites you most about product design today?', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 12, null), ('cmq6i87ei000ioz018nchinj8', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'CANDIDATE', 'For me, product design is like, for me, product design is basically a very challenging role and I am excited about user experience, visualizing and imagining how different users would interact with the same product and then satisfying needs of every such user and at the same time keeping things as simple as it can be. So a user''s requirement and thinking that goes behind understanding what a perfect design would be excites me the most.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 13, null), ('cmq6i87ei000joz01wm21fcnd', 'cmq6hwmpx0003oz01kmuz4va4', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I appreciate that perspective. Thank you for your time today, Sav. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-09 10:36:03.834', 14, null), ('cmq6kf6xg000xoz01rkrejady', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hello.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 0, null), ('cmq6kf6xg000yoz01rw734ugn', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Shubham, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the Junior Mechanical Engineer role. Let’s dive right in. Could you start by explaining the first law of thermodynamics in your own words?', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 1, null), ('cmq6kf6xg000zoz01op1b7s2r', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes. The first law of thermodynamics basically tells you about conservation of energy. The first law says that energy can neither be created nor destroyed. It can only be converted from one form to the other.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 2, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0010oz01ro8uu39l', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, that’s correct. Now, could you describe a common manufacturing process used in mechanical engineering?', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 3, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0011oz01biwx57tf', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'Casting is one of the common manufacturing process used in mechanical engineering.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 4, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0012oz01u0bswuub', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Can you explain briefly how casting works in practice?', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 5, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0013oz01pgc9bmzx', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, basically in casting there is a die in which you pour molten metal. Once the molten metal is poured the entire cast is allowed to cool and after the cooling process is done the cast is taken out of the die then it is machined and brought to actual dimensions by grinding or finishing processes.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 6, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0014oz01xt04j852', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Now, can you explain what additive manufacturing is and how it differs from traditional methods?', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 7, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0015oz01l1vr4dyr', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, additive manufacturing is a non-conventional manufacturing process in which particles or filament of the base metal is deposited layer by layer to form the final product. It is different from the traditional processes because in additive manufacturing the material is deposited or added to make the final product whereas, in conventional manufacturing process is a subtractive manufacturing where you start taking out material from the base metal or the ingot to achieve the final product.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 8, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0016oz01ljjttzla', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Good. One final question for today: how do you see additive manufacturing evolving in the next few years for mechanical engineering applications?', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 9, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0017oz01okgp3sso', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'In the next few years additive manufacturing would be much more robust and will be adopted at large scale. At the same time the manufacturing time for additive manufacturing would improve to a great extent, making it highly competitive in relation to the conventional processes.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 10, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0018oz01jrtyr0vn', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for sharing that. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 11, null), ('cmq6kf6xg0019oz01ff35ni9w', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you. Thank you.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 12, null), ('cmq6kf6xg001aoz01lk2bl33s', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome, Shubham. Take care and goodbye.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 13, null), ('cmq6kf6xg001boz01xm0z1usp', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Take care. Goodbye.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 14, null), ('cmq6kf6xg001coz012fnrm28d', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'Bye.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 15, null), ('cmq6kf6xh001doz013c1hob10', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Goodbye, Shubham. All the best.', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 16, null), ('cmq6kf6xh001eoz01hcojvpxv', 'cmq6k9zpd000toz01r465a6j5', 'CANDIDATE', 'bye-bye', '2026-06-09 11:37:29.045', 17, null), ('cmq6pocad001qoz01758cgbu9', 'cmq6pged8001ooz01ox3l1igc', 'INTERVIEWER', 'The interview ended before a stable realtime connection was established.', '2026-06-09 14:04:33.973', 0, null), ('cmq6qby1y002boz01qdav15xt', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Hi Sana, good evening, this is Aditya Boste and I would like to attend the interview which is scheduled for the position of Manager HR.', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 0, null), ('cmq6qby1y002coz01g7rn3q8q', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hi Aditya, my name is Sana, and I’ll be conducting your interview today for the HR role. Let’s get started—tell me about your background and how it maps to this role.', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 1, null), ('cmq6qby1y002doz0129eroij5', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you, Zana. Can you please repeat the question?', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 2, null), ('cmq6qby1y002eoz019msjt2bx', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Of course, Aditya. Tell me about your background and how it maps to this HR role.', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 3, null), ('cmq6qby1y002foz01zx3vxtva', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', 'So my background is that I am commerce graduate and then afterwards I did my management studies in human resources and after that I joined a company called Siemens where I worked as a management trainee and I worked there as a in HR department in various functions of HR starting from recruitment, learning and development, composition and benefits and then thereafter the global mobility as well as factory HR. So those are the areas where I worked and I have extensive experience in human resource function. So that is the background of mine in human resource function.', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 4, null), ('cmq6qby1y002goz01lzeonntg', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you, Aditya. Now, can you share an example of a challenging HR problem you solved, and what judgment you used?', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 5, null), ('cmq6qby1y002hoz01ytlq61b4', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I see, thanks for that context. What specific steps did you take to navigate that change and achieve results?', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 6, null), ('cmq6qby1y002ioz01qsza9yaw', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', 'so challenging HR problem I''ve encountered during my days in Vadodara at our factory wherein there were a lot of change management happened in terms of culture change in terms of mindset change of the people because the time it was the time wherein the global market in energy was not doing so good and it was impacted India as well and for that matter our factory or the our business as well in India so it was very much important for us to capture the Indian market as well as establish the export market as well so where we have interacted with each and every people understood their capabilities understood their aspirations', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 7, null), ('cmq6qby1y002joz01l4x90m6g', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Now, let’s move to another area—how do you ensure professional standards in your HR work?', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 8, null), ('cmq6qby1y002koz01u8az9gcn', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', 'we tried to link it with whatever business goal we have. Thank you. So the specific steps we took about first of all the narrative we''ve set the narrative that we want to reach a certain goal so we set the goal and we design narrative around that and we inspired people to achieve that goal and for that we also defined the capabilities which has to be acquired by these people so that was the strategy we used and people liked it and people were enjoying the journey. Hi Sanani, I''m waiting for your next question.', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 9, null), ('cmq6qby1y002loz01s8qg0db5', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'How do you ensure professional standards are maintained in your HR practice', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 10, null), ('cmq6qby1y002moz01ovo8azd4', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'CANDIDATE', '算了', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 11, null), ('cmq6qby1y002noz019hj37xlg', 'cmq6q4j8o0029oz01b2lu0et2', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. Let me move to the next question. How do you stay updated on the latest HR trends and best practices?', '2026-06-09 14:22:55.27', 12, null), ('cmq81qdjb0007o501vnhby1h1', 'cmq81nggs0003o501oscmergd', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Good day, Shubham. I’m Sana from test, and I’ll be conducting your interview today. Let’s start with this: Can you tell me about a challenging project you worked on recently and how you approached it?', '2026-06