can you tell me about yourself and your background?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 0, null), ('cmq96ag0m003fo501fl1g8lla', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes, so I''m a mechanical engineer, did my engineering from Mumbai. I have around four years of experience as a solution engineer. I have been working on mechanical projects and handling power plants since then.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 1, null), ('cmq96ag0m003go501ff6yu15x', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Let''s dive a bit deeper. Could you explain the first law of thermodynamics in your own words?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 2, null), ('cmq96ag0m003ho501csipcxzq', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yes, the first law of thermodynamics is about conservation of energy, which says energy cannot be created or destroyed, it can only be converted from one form to the other.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 3, null), ('cmq96ag0m003io501z7akylnm', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'All right. Can you describe a common manufacturing process used in mechanical engineering?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 4, null), ('cmq96ag0m003jo501h0dzj55h', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Testing is one of the processes.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 5, null), ('cmq96ag0m003ko5016tt8xx7d', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Could you elaborate a bit more on that process—what exactly happens during casting?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 6, null), ('cmq96ag0m003lo501dcy8r3gj', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Can you tell me the answer?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 7, null), ('cmq96ag0m003mo5018em3lucp', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I''m here to hear your perspective. Please give it your best shot. What do you know about what happens during casting?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 8, null), ('cmq96ag0n003no50194nuy80t', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Give me some hints, please.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 9, null), ('cmq96ag0n003oo501dbjpegy5', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'I need your input first. Just share what you know about casting, even if it''s brief.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 10, null), ('cmq96ag0n003po5013huap5ln', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so basically casting is a process in which you melt the molten metal into a dye and then allow it to cool and then take the product out and do some finishing job before finally using the product.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 11, null), ('cmq96ag0n003qo5010nnjsymy', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for that. Now, can you explain what additive manufacturing is and how it differs from traditional methods?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 12, null), ('cmq96ag0n003ro501w47h6ypv', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'I am not aware of additive manufacturing.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 13, null), ('cmq96ag0n003so501qrbfj2me', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'That''s fine. Additive manufacturing involves building up layers. Can you share any guess on how it''s used in mechanical engineering?', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 14, null), ('cmq96ag0n003to501v6ohbscj', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'No, I have no idea', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 15, null), ('cmq96ag0n003uo501cwowxo31', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. That''s all right. Thank you for sharing. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 16, null), ('cmq96ag0n003vo501tjex63nt', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Thank you. Thank you very much.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 17, null), ('cmq96ag0n003wo501vw2zzhjq', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'You''re welcome. Take care, and goodbye.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 18, null), ('cmq96ag0n003xo50195u2dkt5', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'CANDIDATE', 'Please end the interview.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 19, null), ('cmq96ag0n003yo501wrsn7eu4', 'cmq965s15003ao501i7sogp7z', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Certainly. Thank you again for your time. Goodbye.', '2026-06-11 07:25:11.446', 20, null), ('cmq96jd0z004ao501q4xeod3t', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Hello Sav, I''m Sana from TEST. Thank you for joining today. Let''s jump right in: Can you tell me about a recent project where you faced a major challenge and how you handled it?', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 0, null), ('cmq96jd0z004bo501sis11r25', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'Yeah, so in my field one of the major projects that I have handled is employee engagement activity where I was responsible to make arrangements for the annual function of a company. It was a difficult task because the number of people were more than 500 and from different places from different cities they were visiting. So to understand the requirements and make the necessary improvements, arrangements was very difficult task. At the same time I managed it by forming a team and delegated activities promptly to each one of them which helped me conduct the event successfully.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 1, null), ('cmq96jd0z004co501mvumh2e3', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How did you measure the success of that engagement activity?', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 2, null), ('cmq96jd0z004do5010k827qc2', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'after the event we took feedback from each and every attendee that was there at the event and based on the score that we got we were able to measure the success', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 3, null), ('cmq96jd0z004eo501a9ly2qwb', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Got it. Now, tell us about your background and how it maps to this HR role.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 4, null), ('cmq96jd0z004fo5019jwp3kub', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, my background is from mechanical engineer, but I have been taking up roles in people management since the start of my career. What has happened so far is I''ve been able to deliver on the responsibilities and the KPIs so far, and that''s how my experience comes in.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 5, null), ('cmq96jd0z004go501ha650tec', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. Can you share a bit more about your specific HR responsibilities in your recent role?', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 6, null), ('cmq96jd10004ho50141y0e6w6', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'I was more into people management and event management. So all the events that used to be That used to happen there I used I would be the lead of those events and I was responsible for the success of all the webinars or seminars or functions and the sports events that Was happening at the company', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 7, null), ('cmq96jd10004io501vhzvqe6i', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Understood. How do you approach problem-solving when dealing with employee conflicts or sensitive HR issues?', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 8, null), ('cmq96jd10004jo501dy9y41v7', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'Communication is what I understand as the most important aspect of it. So, I usually ask all the parties involved to come together and have a conversation and resolve the conflicts.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 9, null), ('cmq96jd10004ko501drnj27uu', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you. And one final question: how do you ensure professional standards in your HR work?', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 10, null), ('cmq96jd10004lo50133lfgb1o', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'CANDIDATE', 'So, there are certain things happening in the company and then the SOPs are good enough to you know, do proper work and conduct.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 11, null), ('cmq96jd10004mo501chmfsi02', 'cmq96dmfb0048o501wqrnrcyk', 'INTERVIEWER', 'Thank you for sharing that. This concludes our interview. Best of luck with the hiring process.', '2026-06-11 07:32:07.475', 12, null), ('cmq9elmc00050o501mrmw7nut', 'cmq9eelzx004yo5013pl3mn1n', 'INTERVIEWER',